[CR CR0073r1 for 38.425] Reason for change: The DDDS from corresponding node that feedback the status of the retransmission NR PDCP PDUs may not be able to tell exactly what is intended, which lead to a different understanding in the PDCP hosting node. Summary of change: Rewording the description with related to the retransmission NR PDCP PDU sequene number, associated with the highest NR-U sequence number. Also a condition of the allocation of the NR-U sequence number is added. Impact Analysis: Impact assessment towards the previous version of the specification (same release): This CR has an impact under protocol point of view. The impact can be considered isolated because the correction impact only on the DDDS on retransmission packet. Consequences if not approved: The spec is not correct.

